{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "lesson-sharding-scatter",
  "name": "Lesson: cross-shard queries",
  "description": "Every read is a query without the shard key, so the coordinator asks all shards and waits for the slowest. Each shard has the same latency: p50 5ms, p99 150ms.",
